Description: Fix the Docker Compose health check path.

The application exposes /health (custom controller), not /actuator/health
(Spring Actuator default path, which is not configured in this app).

--- a/docker-compose.yml
+++ b/docker-compose.yml
@@ app.healthcheck
-      test: ["CMD", "curl", "-f", "http://localhost:8080/actuator/health"]
+      test: ["CMD", "curl", "-f", "http://localhost:8080/health"]
